      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:37:48",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:38:03",
      "utterance": "のんさんは、どうなったら一番嬉しいです？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:39:08",
      "utterance": "夏休み中に二人の記念日があるんですけど、その日に彼がプチ旅行を計画してくれていて、",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:39:17",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:39:41",
      "utterance": "そのことで頻繁に連絡が来るんですけど、結構出れなかったりすることが多くって、",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:39:51",
      "utterance": "ええ",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-07-12T10:40:12",
      "utterance": "そのことでまた怒られちゃって、しかも、",
